“It won’t be easy,” Anna sighed. “Come on. Two biscuits each if you leave right now.”
After some hesitation, the ranks of the opposition fell; the ﬁrst to surrender was Dennis, and Grace followed suit. Each holding two biscuits in their hands, they left without further protests.
