“Certainly, sir,” his wife replied, moving the brush slowly through her shiny locks.

“Certainly, sir,” my foot. They had told him that she had arrived at Rockﬁeld and immediately disappeared. She had probably hidden somewhere in the house in order to read, leaving the staﬀ to themselves. Anna, I know everything you do, he would have liked to say to her. You’re a fool not to understand that. He took a deep breath and asked her again, “Didn’t you do anything else today?”
