He really should have shot his brother two days before, damn it. But instead he hadn’t. Instead, Daniel had raised his pistol and taken aim at a bottle placed on a stump quite a ways from the house. He had pulled the trigger and hit the target. Christopher then took his pistol and brought it into position. Without hesitation he had raised his arm, and almost without aiming he ﬁred, hitting his target.
